research findings as reported in the public record and is not
authoritative on any subject it covers. No strategy, parameter, or
example discussed in this book is a recommendation to buy, sell, or
hold any security, derivative, or financial instrument. Past
performance, whether backtested, simulated, or live, does not
guarantee future results. Readers seeking guidance on any investment
matter should consult qualified financial professionals. Do not place
trades, allocate capital, or modify any investment strategy based on
